      "machineHash": "484b606836c7687d8bf2e13841f58f8cfd6be1a0a0cfad9347f85c2f8253e1b8",
      "machineText": "`NewNotchWindow` memerlukan `-tags private_mac_apis` agar konten web transparan dapat menampilkan bentuk notch native. Tanpa tag tersebut, panel, penempatan, dan animasi tetap berfungsi, tetapi webview tetap buram. Lihat [API macOS privat](/guides/build/private-macos-apis/#webview-transparency-and-background).",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "`NewNotchWindow` requires `-tags private_mac_apis` for transparent web content to reveal the native …",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
